 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You are far from your marches.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The marches can spare me for a day.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Only a day?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Perhaps two.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This cannot continue.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "No.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "It is noticed. People talk. Ramayyan has already written three lines about it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Only three?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Come to Velinadu. When you are ready to speak plainly.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Not before.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "She asks. Not commands.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "That is already different.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan Pillai.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Or do you still answer to Nagoji when you dream?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Depends on the dream.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You have not grown less infuriating.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "My uncles bring proposals every week. Men of good lineage. Men with land. Men whose feet are firmly planted in this red soil.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "They promise safety.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And yet you sent a green cloth to a landless Maratha.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Because safety bores me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "But fear does not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I am afraid, Nagoji. Not of war. Of you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Me?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "If I marry you, will you stay true?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Or will you one day wake, smell the dust of the north, and ride back to your hills, leaving me with memories and ghosts?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The Deccan is my past. You are my present.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Present is fleeting. And there is another thing. A harder thing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not a woman who walks three paces behind. I am the matriarch of Velinadu. I sit in councils. I command men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Can you, a warrior who has ridden with kings, accept a woman as his equal?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Not in the shadows. In the light.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have ridden with Padmini Amma. I know what a woman with iron in her spine looks like.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini is your mother by oath. I would be your wife. It is different.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "A husband expects to rule. Here, you will not rule.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This is *Marumakkathayam*, Nagoji. The lineage runs through the women.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "If we have children, sons or daughters, they will belong to Velinadu. Of my house, not yours.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You will be the father, loved and honoured. But you will be a visitor in their heritage.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Can your pride accept that? Can you watch your son grow up belonging to a world where you are always, in some small way, a guest?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My pride died at Colachel. It was reborn as something else.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Something that values the root over the branch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will always be a guest here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If you can spare me a corner of your house and a sliver of your heart, that is enough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You already hold more than a sliver. But I have responsibilities.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You are an honoured guest here, and a guest under Padmanabha's sky. This land was never yours to own. Only to serve.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My own house is a neem in the fort courtyard and a jackfruit in Padmini's yard.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My only property is a horse that does not like cannon smoke.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Then you lose nothing you truly possess.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And gain nieces who will argue with you and sons who will pretend to listen.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini knows?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "She was the one who told me to stop being proud and send for you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "She said, \"If you must refuse him, do it with a full stomach, not an empty bed.\"",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And Ramayyan?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "He has already written three lines about the possible outcomes. He will adjust the fourth when we tell him what we have decided.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My name in the Deccan is already a ghost. If I marry you, I do not become lord of Velinadu. I become another story whispered in its corridors.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. One more story. One more thread in the cloth. That is all any of us are.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then let it be written.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not expect wedding songs. We are too old for that nonsense.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are. I, on the other hand, am ageless.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You will sleep in the small room near the western verandah. Morning rites when you are here. Drills when you are not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You will not teach our nieces to gamble with cowrie shells.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I make no promises about the cowries.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You could have sent word earlier. I had to bribe three boatmen and outride a tax collector to get here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Revathi does not believe in long engagements.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "So. The last of us to fall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You never fell.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am going back. To the Deccan. I miss my parents. I miss the dry air.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not of this place, Ananthan. I am homesick.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "No. I will not carry a foreign king's treasure. It suits you here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am tying myself to this coast. Take it, Dhanaji.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are the one man who remembers the Deccan boy under my skin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If the gods cut you down, let your son come south with it. Let him find me by the conch and the gold. I will not turn him away.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You swear that?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I swear it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "If anyone asks, I stole it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If anyone asks, tell them you earned it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST"
   ],
   "text": "Take it. Tie it, and she is yours. She ties her thread to you, and you are hers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "temple_priest"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST"
   ],
   "text": "Three knots for three lives. Past, present, and what is yet to come.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "temple_priest"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST (off)"
   ],
   "text": "For the past. For all that brought you to this moment.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST (off)"
   ],
   "text": "For the present. For what you are to each other now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST (off)"
   ],
   "text": "For what is yet to come. For children and grandchildren. For the thread that continues after you are both dust.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST (off)"
   ],
   "text": "It is done.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You did not drop it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I almost did.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I know. I felt your hands shaking. The great cavalry commander, terrified of a piece of string.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The string is easy. It is what it means that terrifies me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Stay terrified. It will keep you honest.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Ramayyan invented this. During a siege, when we had many vegetables and little else.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He told the cooks to combine everything and pray.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You invented a dish?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I solved a logistics problem. The cooks merely executed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Do you feel married?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I feel like a guest who has been told he may stay past sunset.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Never forget you are that. When you ride out, you carry my name now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You carry the children we may have. Do not make them spit when they say \"Ananthan Pillai.\"",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "My mother died when I was young. Sometimes I try to remember her face and find only the lines other people drew for me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I do not want our children to know me only as a name in Ramayyan's leaves.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "They will know me as the woman who sent their father to the marches. Do not let them hate me for that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If they must hate anyone, let it be me. I will tell them it was my choice to ride. Yours to keep the roof over their heads.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Come.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "No cellar tonight. No hiding. You are my husband now. This is your room as much as mine.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It does not feel like mine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "It will. Give it time.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "In the cellar, we were thieves. Stealing hours.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Tonight we are not thieves. There is nothing to hide from.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I find I do not know how to do this without hiding. I have been a widow so long that secrecy became a skin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Help me shed it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We learn together.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You are older.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "So are you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I have earned it. You have merely survived.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 4,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Survival is its own earning.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I should go. Before the servants...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You should stay. You are not a guest anymore, Ananthan. You can be here when the sun rises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "It will take time to stop feeling like a thief.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "It took me years to stop feeling like a widow. We are both haunted. But perhaps haunted people can keep each other company.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Company. Yes. I think I can do that.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  }
 ]
}